onnected ? 'online' : 'offline'\">\n          <span class=\"status-dot\"></span>\n          <span>{{ ttsConnected ? 'TTS 在线' : 'TTS 未连接' }}</span>\n          <button class=\"refresh-icon-btn\" title=\"刷新 TTS 状态\" @click=\"$emit('check-tts')\">\n            <RefreshCw :size=\"14\" />\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"header-action\" @click=\"$emit('open-llm-config')\">\n          <Settings2 :size=\"15\" />\n          <span>LLM 设置</span>\n          <span v-if=\"hasLlmKey\" class=\"status-pill success\">已配置</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"header-action\" @click=\"$emit('open-mapping')\">\n          <LibraryBig :size=\"15\" />\n          <span>音频库</span>\n          <span class=\"count-pill\">{{ refCount }}</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"header-action\" @click=\"$emit('open-tts-config')\">\n          <SlidersHorizontal :size=\"15\" />\n          <span>合成参数</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"header-action\" @click=\"$emit('open-history')\">\n          <History :size=\"15\" />\n          <span>历史任务</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"header-action\" @click=\"$emit('open-logs')\">\n          <ScrollText :size=\"15\" />\n          <span>运行日志</span>\n          <span v-if=\"errorCount > 0\" class=\"status-pill danger\">{{ errorCount }}</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"close-studio-btn\" title=\"关闭工作台 (可随时重新打开)\" @click=\"$emit('close')\">\n          <X :size=\"18\" />\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n</template>\n\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { computed } from 'vue'\nimport {\n  History,\n  LibraryBig,\n  Mic2,\n  RefreshCw,\n  ScrollText,\n  Settings2,\n  SlidersHorizontal,\n  X\n} from 'lucide-vue-next'\nimport { logs } from '../services/logger'\n\ndefineProps<{\n  ttsConnected: boolean\n  hasLlmKey: boolean\n  refCount: number\n}>()\n\ndefineEmits<{\n  (e: 'check-tts'): void\n  (e: 'open-llm-config'): void\n  (e: 'open-mapping'): void\n  (e: 'open-tts-config'): void\n  (e: 'open-logs'): void\n  (e: 'open-history'): void\n  (e: 'close'): void\n}>()\n\nconst errorCount = computed(() => logs.value.filter(l => l.level === 'error').length)\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.studio-header {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  background: var(--paper);\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.header-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.brand-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.brand-icon {\n  width: 38px;\n  height: 38px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(184, 134, 11, 0.4);\n  background: rgba(184, 134, 11, 0.08);\n  color: var(--gold);\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.brand-title {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-family: var(--font-display);\n}\n\n.brand-subtitle {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: var(--muted-ink);\n}\n\n.actions-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.status-indicator {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  height: 36px;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.status-indicator.online {\n  color: var(--success);\n}\n\n.status-indicator.offline {\n  color: var(--danger);\n}\n\n.status-dot {\n  width: 7px;\n  height: 7px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: currentColor;\n}\n\n.refresh-icon-btn {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  color: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 2px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n.refresh-icon-btn:hover {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.header-action {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  height: 36px;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  background: var(--paper);\n  padding: 0 12px;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  transition: all 150ms ease;\n}\n\n.header-action:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n  background: var(--surface);\n}\n\n.status-pill, .count-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  padding: 1px 5px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.status-pill.success {\n  background: rgba(40, 112, 77, 0.12);\n  color: var(--success);\n  border: 1px solid var(--success);\n}\n\n.status-pill.danger {\n  background: rgba(168, 59, 50, 0.12);\n  color: var(--danger);\n  border: 1px solid var(--danger);\n}\n\n.count-pill {\n  color: var(--gold);\n  background: rgba(184, 134, 11, 0.1);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.close-studio-btn {\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  background: var(--paper);\n  color: var(--muted-ink);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 150ms ease;\n  margin-left: 4px;\n}\n\n.close-studio-btn:hover {\n  border-color: var(--danger);\n  color: var(--danger);\n  background: rgba(168, 59, 50, 0.08);\n}\n</style>\n"],"sourceRoot":""}]);
